The doubletrs package bundles the following Rust crates in
src/rust/vendor.tar.xz. Each is listed with its authors and license.

crossbeam-deque 0.8.8 (MIT OR Apache-2.0): The crossbeam-deque developers
  https://github.com/crossbeam-rs/crossbeam
crossbeam-epoch 0.9.21 (MIT OR Apache-2.0): The crossbeam-epoch developers
  https://github.com/crossbeam-rs/crossbeam
crossbeam-utils 0.8.23 (MIT OR Apache-2.0): The crossbeam-utils developers
  https://github.com/crossbeam-rs/crossbeam
either 1.18.0 (MIT OR Apache-2.0): The either developers
  https://github.com/rayon-rs/either
extendr-api 0.9.0 (MIT): The extendr-api developers
  https://github.com/extendr/extendr
extendr-ffi 0.9.0 (MIT): The extendr-ffi developers
  https://github.com/extendr/extendr
extendr-macros 0.9.0 (MIT): The extendr-macros developers
  https://github.com/extendr/extendr
lazy_static 1.5.0 (MIT OR Apache-2.0): Marvin Löbel
  https://github.com/rust-lang-nursery/lazy-static.rs
